msgid "What's happened to the terminal?\\n"
msgstr "あれ、端末が？\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_084"
msgid "You vandal - you've broken it.\\n"
msgstr "このー、壊しやがって！\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_085"
msgid "Connection broken - experiments still active.\\n"
msgstr "接続不能　実験がまだアクティブです。\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_086"
msgid "Experimental item 1 acquired.\\n"
msgstr "実験アイテム１を入手した\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_087"
msgid "Experimental item 2 acquired.\\n"
msgstr "実験アイテム２を入手した\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_088"
msgid "Experimental item 3 acquired.\\n"
msgstr "実験アイテム３を入手した\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_089"
msgid "Obtain CamSpy.\\n"
msgstr "Obtain CamSpy.\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_090"
msgid "Dr. Caroll's\\n"
msgstr "Dr. Caroll's\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_091"
msgid "CamSpy\\n"
msgstr "カムスパイ\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_092"
msgid "A CamSpy\\n"
msgstr "カムスパイ\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_093"
msgid "Picked up a CamSpy.\\n"
msgstr "カムスパイを手に入れた\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_094"
msgid ""
"That's the highest security sector - Dr. Caroll \\nhas got to be nearby.\\n"
msgstr "ここは最も警備がかたいエリアだ。\\nドクター・キャロルは近くにいるに違いない。\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_095"
msgid "Something around here's using a lot of power.\\n"
msgstr "この近くの何かが\\nすごいエネルギーを使っているわ\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_096"
msgid "Reprogram that cleaning bot - \\nit'll give you a way in.\\n"
msgstr "クリーニングロボットのプログラムを改造せよ。\\nそれで奥へと行けるはずだ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_097"
msgid "Get out, Jo! The levels are too high. \\nUse the CamSpy.\\n"
msgstr "放射能レベルが高過ぎる。外に出ろ！\\nジョアンナ、カムスパイを使え。\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_098"
msgid "Secret weapons compartment opened.\\n"
msgstr "秘密ウェポンのコンパートメントが開いた\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_099"
msgid "Enemy detected - weapon cache locked.\\n"
msgstr "敵発見　武器倉庫がロックされた\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_100"
msgid "Dr. Caroll?\\n"
msgstr "ドクター・キャロル？\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_101"
msgid "Dr. Caroll, are you here?\\n"
msgstr "ドクター・キャロル、ここですか？\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_102"
msgid "Well, is it safe to come out?\\n"
msgstr "もう、外に出ても大丈夫かな？\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_103"
msgid "Yes, all clear.\\n"
msgstr "ええ、この辺の敵は全て片付けたわ。\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_104"
msgid "Wh..what... you're...\\n"
msgstr "ちょっと、あ、あなたは…\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_105"
msgid ""
"Very professionally done, my dear, but there's \\nno time to waste! We must "
"leave immediately!\\n"
msgstr "さすがプロの仕事は見事だな！\\nすぐにここから逃げなくては！\\n"

msgctxt "L_EAR_106"
msgid "Come on. I have vital information, and you \\nmust protect me.\\n"
msgstr "私は貴重な情報を持っている。\\n行こう、しっかり守ってくれよ！\\n"
